    {
      "id": "uToKiup-Unm54kyeTKZJQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1802.5552970412189,
      "y": 8810.399652262022,
      "width": 215.0719451904297,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 850471932,
      "version": 985,
      "versionNonce": 708848023,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792293567724,
      "created": 1790238105532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这里xpadmin其实有2种回复方\n式。\n第一种是直接往房间种发消\n息。\n第二种是引用对方的消息，再\n发送\n\n这2种方式在java中间层处理\n的方式不一样，当有多个微信\n用户通过clawbot连接到\nopenclaw之后，xpadmin直接\n在房间中发消息，这个消息会\n固定通过某个clawbot发给某\n个固定的用户，如果是引用某\n条消息则会发给当事人",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jpbUyXdMwspvWqcq-8u0X",
      "originalText": "这里xpadmin其实有2种回复方式。\n第一种是直接往房间种发消息。\n第二种是引用对方的消息，再发送\n\n这2种方式在java中间层处理的方式不一样，当有多个微信用户通过clawbot连接到openclaw之后，xpadmin直接在房间中发消息，这个消息会固定通过某个clawbot发给某个固定的用户，如果是引用某条消息则会发给当事人",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aW0SzQJcblD_h-Ni5XRns",
      "type": "stickynote",
      "x": -244.1596771936819,
      "y": 9952.964552119161,
      "width": 152.21322818658038,
      "height": 367.0109082438783,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffdf6b",
