    },
    {
      "id": "ZChLuMKD-9JzvFNOkhMg6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -228.1596771936819,
      "y": 9968.964552119161,
      "width": 117.93540954589844,
      "height": 315.0109082438783,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1297996412,
      "version": 2248,
      "versionNonce": 232054455,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792293567725,
      "created": 1790143014062,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "微信 session 列表\n来自 sessions.list，字段只有 key，过\n滤出 openclaw-weixin。\n\n微信会话历史消息\n来自 chat.history，字段包括：\n\nsessionKey\n\nmessages[].role\n\nmessages[].content\n\nmessages[].timestamp\n\nmessages[].__openclaw.id\n\n实时微信入站事件\n来自 event=chat 和\nevent=session.message，字段包括：\n\nsessionKey\n\nrole\n\ntext\n\nsenderId\n\nsenderName\n\nid / messageId / _id\n\ntimestamp\n\n握手元信息\n来自 hello-ok，只用于确认连接。",
      "fontSize": 6.811046664732505,
      "baseFontSize": 6.811046664732505,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "aW0SzQJcblD_h-Ni5XRns",
      "originalText": "微信 session 列表\n来自 sessions.list，字段只有 key，过滤出 openclaw-weixin。\n\n微信会话历史消息\n来自 chat.history，字段包括：\n\nsessionKey\n\nmessages[].role\n\nmessages[].content\n\nmessages[].timestamp\n\nmessages[].__openclaw.id\n\n实时微信入站事件\n来自 event=chat 和 event=session.message，字段包括：\n\nsessionKey\n\nrole\n\ntext\n\nsenderId\n\nsenderName\n\nid / messageId / _id\n\ntimestamp\n\n握手元信息\n来自 hello-ok，只用于确认连接。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "contpd4Ei4teXOL95P-M9",
