    {
      "id": "itP3r-qDQOCxoAwOBca8D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 812.4221753993291,
      "y": 5384.195691481578,
      "width": 466.8301497818304,
      "height": 109.98586370337884,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2122485116,
      "version": 748,
      "versionNonce": 444829431,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792293567725,
      "created": 1789959954987,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "要做的事情：\n1. openclaw端的插件。\n     负责与微信服务器通信\n       从微信服务器拉取消息，把openclaw回复发送给微信服务器\n2. 微信(企微)客户端开启机器人。\n     负责用户与微信服务器之间的通信\n3. openclaw配置，将机器人与openclaw的channel进行绑定，确保消息能够正确到达",
      "fontSize": 12.569812994671869,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "要做的事情：\n1. openclaw端的插件。\n     负责与微信服务器通信\n       从微信服务器拉取消息，把openclaw回复发送给微信服务器\n2. 微信(企微)客户端开启机器人。\n     负责用户与微信服务器之间的通信\n3. openclaw配置，将机器人与openclaw的channel进行绑定，确保消息能够正确到达",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
