      "updated": 1792293567725,
      "created": 1789988932578,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "src/main/java/com/xp/openclaw_test/\n├── OpenClawTestApplication.java       # 启动类\n├── config/\n│   ├── OpenClawConfig.java            # RestTemplate Bean\n│   ├── TokenAuthFilter.java           # 内部 API 鉴权\n│   └── AutoLoginFilter.java           # 身份注入\n├── controller/\n│   ├── ChatController.java            # POST /api/chat\n│   ├── SessionController.java         # 会话管理\n│   └── HealthController.java          # 健康检查\n├── model/\n│   ├── ChatRequest.java               # 请求体\n│   └── ChatResponse.java              # 响应体\n└── service/\n    ├── OpenClawService.java           # 业务封装\n    └── OpenClawGatewayClient.java     # WebSocket 客户端（核心）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "src/main/java/com/xp/openclaw_test/\n├── OpenClawTestApplication.java       # 启动类\n├── config/\n│   ├── OpenClawConfig.java            # RestTemplate Bean\n│   ├── TokenAuthFilter.java           # 内部 API 鉴权\n│   └── AutoLoginFilter.java           # 身份注入\n├── controller/\n│   ├── ChatController.java            # POST /api/chat\n│   ├── SessionController.java         # 会话管理\n│   └── HealthController.java          # 健康检查\n├── model/\n│   ├── ChatRequest.java               # 请求体\n│   └── ChatResponse.java              # 响应体\n└── service/\n    ├── OpenClawService.java           # 业务封装\n    └── OpenClawGatewayClient.java     # WebSocket 客户端（核心）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
